cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this version."
title: "Loaded CMJ System Identification"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"

authors:
  - family-names: "Rodriguez"
    given-names: "Julio"

abstract: >-
  Loaded CMJ System Identification is a mechanics-first MuJoCo framework for
  reproducible rigid-body system identification of a fixed 20 kg loaded
  countermovement jump. The project integrates bilateral force-platform
  measurements, bar-mounted linear-position-transducer kinematics,
  deterministic synthetic trials, bounded parameter estimation,
  mechanics-based validation, and MakeHuman scientific visualization.

repository-code: "https://github.com/Litju/loaded-cmj-system-identification"

license: "Apache-2.0"

keywords:
  - MuJoCo
  - biomechanics
  - countermovement jump
  - loaded countermovement jump
  - force platform
  - linear position transducer
  - system identification
  - rigid-body dynamics
  - parameter estimation
  - scientific computing
